{"file": "末世度假酒店-第56集.mp4", "ep": 56, "duration": 50.6, "segments": [{"start": 0.62, "end": 2.22, "text": "夏老板直说卖价吧"}, {"start": 2.22, "end": 3.22, "text": "如果合适"}, {"start": 3.22, "end": 4.22, "text": "我买点也可以"}, {"start": 4.22, "end": 5.42, "text": "怎么能白吃你的东西"}, {"start": 5.42, "end": 6.42, "text": "不贵不贵"}, {"start": 6.42, "end": 7.22, "text": "便宜着呢"}, {"start": 7.22, "end": 8.22, "text": "完了"}, {"start": 8.22, "end": 9.62, "text": "这是被宰的钱罩"}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 10.62, "text": "真不贵"}, {"start": 10.62, "end": 12.22, "text": "才卖三几分一个"}, {"start": 12.22, "end": 13.02, "text": "什么"}, {"start": 13.02, "end": 14.41, "text": "几分"}, {"start": 14.41, "end": 18.55, "text": "我也不想卖这么便宜啊"}, {"start": 18.55, "end": 20.15, "text": "可这是系统规定"}, {"start": 20.15, "end": 21.28, "text": "行"}, {"start": 21.28, "end": 23.02, "text": "可以"}, {"start": 23.02, "end": 24.21, "text": "你可别后悔啊"}, {"start": 24.21, "end": 25.41, "text": "要不要签一份合同"}, {"start": 25.41, "end": 26.41, "text": "再按照手印"}, {"start": 26.41, "end": 28.46, "text": "有了这些橘子"}, {"start": 28.46, "end": 30.66, "text": "战友们的口腔昆扬就有救了"}, {"start": 30.66, "end": 36.32, "text": "多谢夏老板了"}, {"start": 36.32, "end": 37.52, "text": "一共多少几分"}, {"start": 37.52, "end": 38.32, "text": "我刷给你"}, {"start": 38.32, "end": 39.52, "text": "合饭240"}, {"start": 39.52, "end": 40.52, "text": "橘子60"}, {"start": 40.52, "end": 41.52, "text": "卫生金100"}, {"start": 41.52, "end": 42.52, "text": "一共400几分"}, {"start": 42.52, "end": 43.52, "text": "请刷卡"}]}